{
  "id": "core.imports",
  "title": "Moving your books into Celerp",
  "summary": "Bring a company over from another accounting system, from upload to the final check.",
  "keywords": ["import", "migrate", "migration", "move", "switch", "QuickBooks", "Xero", "Sage", "Odoo", "opening balances", "cutover"],
  "routes": ["/setup/new-company/migrate", "/setup/new-company", "/setup/new-company/fresh", "/migrations/{run_id}", "/migrations/{run_id}/verify", "/migrations/{run_id}/complete", "/migrations/{run_id}/discard"],
  "permission": "manage_company_settings",
  "order": 6,
  "checked": "73d37c5bee1c01405a604c0798d0ef983baee37937172b7a9b8015181b974696",
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "To add a company, open {title}: {fresh} creates an empty company you set up step by step, and {move} brings a company's books over from another accounting system.",
      "labels": {"title": "setup.new_company_title", "fresh": "setup.card_fresh", "move": "setup.card_move"},
      "image": "img/imports-1.webp",
      "capture": {"route": "/setup/new-company", "selector": ".auth-container", "actions": [], "evidence": ["{title}", "{fresh}", "{move}"]}
    },
    {
      "text": "For an empty company, enter its {name} and choose {go}.",
      "labels": {"name": "label.company_name", "go": "btn.continue"},
      "image": "img/imports-2.webp",
      "capture": {"route": "/setup/new-company/fresh", "selector": ".auth-container", "actions": [], "evidence": ["{name}", "{go}"]}
    },
    {
      "text": "Under {src}, choose {sys}, upload the export file it gives you and click {analyze}. Nothing is created yet.",
      "labels": {"src": "migration.step_source", "sys": "migration.source_label", "analyze": "migration.analyze"},
      "image": "img/imports-3.webp",
      "capture": {"route": "/setup/new-company/migrate", "selector": ".migration-wizard", "actions": [], "evidence": ["{src}", "{sys}"]}
    },
    {
      "text": "Under {cov}, choose how much to bring. Full history recreates every transaction in the file. Cutover starts your books on a date you pick: balances on that date become opening balances, and open invoices, bills and stock are recreated.",
      "labels": {"cov": "migration.step_coverage"},
      "image": "img/imports-4.webp",
      "capture": {"route": "/setup/new-company/migrate", "selector": ".migration-wizard", "actions": [{"click": "button:has-text('Try a sample migration')"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(2) .step-num--active"}], "evidence": ["{cov}"]}
    },
    {
      "text": "Some files leave a question open under {map}, such as which currency a Sage 50 company keeps its books in. Celerp suggests an answer from the file; check it before you go on. A file that leaves nothing open, like the sample, goes straight to {rev}.",
      "labels": {"map": "migration.step_mapping", "rev": "migration.step_review"},
      "image": "img/imports-5.webp",
      "capture": {"route": "/setup/new-company/migrate", "selector": ".migration-wizard", "actions": [{"click": "button:has-text('Try a sample migration')"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(2) .step-num--active"}, {"click": "form[action$='/decisions'] button[type=submit]"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(3) .step-num--active"}], "evidence": [".step-label--active:text-is('{map}')", ".migration-wizard form .form-group"]}
    },
    {
      "text": "Under {rev}, read the summary of what will be created, then start the import. The new company is created and the records move over.",
      "labels": {"rev": "migration.step_review"},
      "image": "img/imports-6.webp",
      "capture": {"route": "/setup/new-company/migrate", "selector": ".migration-wizard", "actions": [{"click": "button:has-text('Try a sample migration')"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(2) .step-num--active"}, {"click": "form[action$='/decisions'] button[type=submit]"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(4) .step-num--active"}], "evidence": [".step-label--active:text-is('{rev}')"]}
    },
    {
      "text": "Under {ver}, Celerp compares its totals with the totals in your file. Review each difference before you finish; you can also fix the file and upload it again.",
      "labels": {"ver": "migration.step_verify"},
      "image": "img/imports-7.webp",
      "capture": {"route": "/setup/new-company/migrate", "selector": ".migration-wizard", "actions": [{"click": "button:has-text('Try a sample migration')"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(2) .step-num--active"}, {"click": "form[action$='/decisions'] button[type=submit]"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(4) .step-num--active"}, {"click": "form[action$='/start'] button[type=submit]"}, {"wait": "#migration-progress a[href$='/verify']"}, {"click": "#migration-progress a[href$='/verify']"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(6) .step-num--active"}], "evidence": [".step-label--active:text-is('{ver}')", ".migration-wizard table thead"]}
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the import starts, a progress page shows each step with what was created, skipped or failed. You can leave the page: the move keeps running.",
      "labels": {},
      "image": "img/imports-8.webp",
      "capture": {"route": "/setup/new-company/migrate", "selector": ".migration-wizard", "actions": [{"click": "button:has-text('Try a sample migration')"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(2) .step-num--active"}, {"click": "form[action$='/decisions'] button[type=submit]"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(4) .step-num--active"}, {"click": "form[action$='/start'] button[type=submit]"}, {"wait": "#migration-progress a[href$='/verify']"}], "evidence": ["#migration-progress table"]}
    },
    {
      "text": "Before you choose {fin}, pick the account Celerp asks for under each posting role; it suggests one from your chart. Finishing completes the move and the company opens from there. A move you no longer want can be discarded from its progress page, which removes the new company and everything imported into it.",
      "labels": {"fin": "migration.finish"},
      "image": "img/imports-9.webp",
      "capture": {"route": "/setup/new-company/migrate", "selector": "form[action$='/finalize']", "actions": [{"click": "button:has-text('Try a sample migration')"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(2) .step-num--active"}, {"click": "form[action$='/decisions'] button[type=submit]"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(4) .step-num--active"}, {"click": "form[action$='/start'] button[type=submit]"}, {"wait": "#migration-progress a[href$='/verify']"}, {"click": "#migration-progress a[href$='/verify']"}, {"wait": ".wizard-step:nth-child(6) .step-num--active"}], "evidence": ["#posting-accounts h3"]}
    },
    {
      "text": "You can also ask the assistant to move your books for you: it can read the export files you give it, start the move and take you through the review. It shows each change as a card and makes it only when you confirm.",
      "labels": {},
      "image": "img/imports-10.webp",
      "capture": {"route": "/setup/new-company/migrate", "selector": ".migration-wizard", "actions": [], "evidence": ["h1.auth-title"]}
    }
  ],
  "related": ["core.companies"]
}
